<title>USA: Smith Barney wins Broward, Fla., $41 mln RANs.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney wins Broward, Fla., $41 mln RANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. on Tuesday won $41 million of Broward, Fla., revenue anticipation notes (RANs).</p>
<p>The net interest cost was 3.882273 percent and the coupon is 4.5 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
